@authToken = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/identity/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@skarbiec.local",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!123"
}

### Dashboard — the user's latest snapshot (byPortfolio rows carry percentage of net worth)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — range: 1M | 1Y | YTD | MAX (default 1Y), one point per snapshot date; response carries points plus changePln / changePercent (null without two points)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Net worth history — one asset class (AssetClass int: 3 = Etf), 0 on days the class was not held
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reporting/net-worth-history?range=1Y&assetClass=3
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
